     5	Protocol:
     6	
     7	- At step `t`, the market reveals `P_t in [0,1]`.
     8	- The learner picks a quote `a_t in [0,1]`.
     9	- For all `t' < t`, if `a_{t'} < P_t`, then quote `a_{t'}` trades and earns reward `a_{t'}`.
    10	
    11	For a quote `a` posted at time `t`, define
    12	
    13	```tex
    14	\tau_t(a) := \min \{s > 0 : P_{t+s} > a\}.
    15	```
    16	
    17	The reward from posting quote `a` at time `t` over horizon `T` is
    18	
    19	```tex
    20	r_t(a) = a \mathbf 1\{\tau_t(a) \le T-t\}.
    21	```
    22	
    23	The regret is
