   294	\mathcal R_G(\Theta)=\Phi_G(\Theta).
   295	\]
   296	Proof sketch: Product closedness makes \(C=\overline C^{pt}\), so the product-closure formula becomes the true minimax value. Equivalently, finite-intersection compactness turns uniformly feasible finite-subclass controls into one reward vector controlling all worlds.
