   469	## Lemma: General identical-prefix Bayes-gap lower bound
   470	Status: proved for finite-horizon minimax classes
   471	Assumptions: Two laws are observationally identical for \(D\) decision rounds; early reward curves are identical copies \(g_i(a)\) within each world; later rewards are zero, common, or otherwise controlled so the fixed comparator contribution is exactly the early sum.
